# The issue: when we compile "print(1+2)", the parser looks up "print" in _ENV.
# _ENV is a local variable (upvalue) in the main chunk.
# But when we EXECUTE the chunk, the _ENV upvalue points to where?
# 
# In our f_parser (in ldo.c):
